    "variable": "the micro-drama 'gossip loading' pattern with a progress chip that climbs every shot (10%, 30%, 99%, 0%) and an open cliffhanger ending plus a 'Comment GOSSIP for Part 2' caption, to test whether an unfinished story drives comments and rewatches",
